      "text": [
        "3633 - وَ قَالَ اَلرِّضَا عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"لاَ تَبْذُلْ لِإِخْوَانِكَ مِنْ نَفْسِكَ مَا ضَرَرُهُ عَلَيْكَ أَكْثَرُ مِنْ نَفْعِهِ لَهُمْ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3633 - Imam Ali ibn Musa Ar-Ridha (as) said:\n\"Do not give to your brothers from yourself what causes you more harm than it benefits them.\""
        ]
      }
